      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>WallX v0.0.3</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Wallpaper Library</b> with thumbnail previews of your last 5 videos.</li>
          <li><b>Playlist rotation</b> (15 min / 30 min / hourly / on wake) with Shuffle.</li>
          <li><b>Per-display videos</b> — a different video on each monitor.</li>
          <li><b>Low Power mode</b> — drops to 15 FPS on battery.</li>
          <li>Live <b>Opacity</b> and <b>Volume</b> sliders, and a <b>frame-rate slider</b>.</li>
          <li>Pause on Battery and Pause in Fullscreen options.</li>
          <li>Reorganized menu, single Start/Stop toggle, Reset All Settings.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
